---
source: crates/tui/tests/render.rs
expression: "screen(&mut model, 120, 30)"
---
"┌ Tasks (5/5┌ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐────────────┐"
"│IN PROGRESS│k/Up, j/Down        move the selection                                                       │            │"
"│  [ 1] #A F│g/Home, G/End       first / last task                                                        │            │"
"│           │C-u/PgUp, C-d/PgDn  move ten tasks                                                           │            │"
"│READY (2)  │C-k, C-j            move the task up / down within its status group (tasq move)              │            │"
"│  [12] #B R│z/Space             fold / unfold the group                                                  │            │"
"│  [ 3] #C W│a, T                show / hide done tasks; only today's work (doing, due, overdue)          │            │"
"│           │/                   filter: text matches titles, #word a status, tag or priority             │            │"
"│LATER (1)  │Esc                 clear the filter, close the detail or a dialog                           │            │"
"│  [ 4] #B T│c                   create a task in the edit view                                           │            │"
"│           │t                   set the status (workflow statuses, pick by number); reopens a done task  │            │"
"│NO STATUS (│p                   set the priority (A, B, C)                                               │            │"
"│  [ 5] #B C│l                   log a progress note                                                      │            │"
"│           │d                   mark done, with an optional final note                                   │            │"
"│           │e                   edit the task in a form (title, status, priority, due, project, tags)    │            │"
"│           │E, v                open the task file in $EDITOR; read it rendered (tasq view)              │            │"
"│           │Enter               open a work session here (tasq pick)                                     │            │"
"│           │C-Enter             open it in a new window (tasq pick --window)                             │            │"
"│           │S-Enter             open it in a new window without switching to it                          │            │"
"│           │s                   run the sources that run by default (tasq sync)                          │            │"
"│           │S                   pick the sources to run: Space toggles, Enter runs                       │            │"
"│           │r                   reload                                                                   │            │"
"│           │Right, Left         show / hide the selected task's detail                                   │            │"
"│           │Tab, K/C-y, J/C-e   switch between list and detail; scroll the detail                        │            │"
"│           │Enter               in a picker: apply the choice                                            │            │"
"│           │?                   this help                                                                │            │"
"│           │q, C-c              quit                                                                     │            │"
"│           └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── any key closes ┘            │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
"j/k  / filter  c new  t status  p prio  l log  d done  e edit  Enter open  s/S sync  ? help  q quit                     "
